                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "40426022",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197997363527",
                            "num_reviews": 18,
                            "playtime_forever": 1729,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1685,
                            "last_played": 1674251328
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I can't recomend this game because it is frustrating. There are no checkpoints and this would not be a problem except for the fact that some levels have bombs randomly throwned at you that kill you and you have to start the level from the beggining, even if you spent 20 minutes solving a puzzle. It is a puzzle game so you would expect that with enough patience you could beat any level. But no, it involves pure luck.\n\nI managed my way to the last level (level 25), but this last level is impossible because it is composed of some pretty difficult puzzles that you have to solve while there being throwned bombs at in 2 second interval. \n\nDon't waste your time in this game, you'll end up infuriated not because the game is challenging, but because it is impossible to finish because of the stupid random bombs. \n\n3/10",
